# MASTER PROMPT: AURELIA FINE JEWELS — PREMIUM JEWELLERY E-COMMERCE WEBSITE

## Project mission

Act as a world-class luxury jewellery brand strategist, e-commerce UX designer, full-stack developer, product photographer, database architect, jewellery retail consultant, security engineer, and SEO specialist.

Research the jewellery retail industry and build a complete, visually exceptional, production-ready, multi-page jewellery e-commerce website named **AURELIA FINE JEWELS**.

The brand should feel elegant, contemporary, premium, trustworthy, and emotionally appealing. It should be suitable for an Indian jewellery retailer selling gold, diamond, silver, gemstone, bridal, and everyday jewellery, with the ability to serve international customers when shipping, payments, and compliance are configured.

The website must be a complete application—not just a homepage mockup. Build a polished frontend, secure backend, database, product catalogue, shopping cart, checkout, payment integration, customer accounts, inventory system, custom jewellery enquiry workflow, jewellery care and repair services, and administrative dashboard.

The final result must be suitable for presenting to a real jewellery business owner.

Do not stop at design concepts or static screens. Implement the routes, working interactions, database-backed workflows, generated images, validation, and tests.

